  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of protection, care and health services to the Earthquake affected people in Northwest Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Older people and their families have their needs met by the wider humanitarian response due to HelpAge International strengthening of coordination mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Older people and their families have their protection, MHPSS and health needs met through integrated health and social care provision</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Older people&apos;s rights are recognised by stakeholders and their communities</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Older people, including older people with disabilities, have improved asccess to protection and health services, have their rights respected and their overall well-being improved.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Older women and men have greater economic independence</narrative>
  </description>
